## Prefix scenario domains with Zz and purge leftovers at campaign start
================================================================================

Context: Campaign domains mixed with real registry entries. Names cannot
contain underscores (CamelCase alphanumeric only), so the ``ZZ_`` prefix
becomes ``Zz``. A new scenario 0 deletes leftover ``Zz*`` / ``ZZ_*``
folders (and the pre-rename ``testscenario1`` / ``testzerocopy`` /
``testmetadataintegrity`` / ``salesdomain`` ones) before the journey
recreates them.

Changes:

1. tests/e2e/scenarios/_harness.py
   Canonical ``Zz*`` domain constants, leftover matcher, and
   ``purge_campaign_domains``.
